      <Placemark>
        <name>*Cédrière, Parc National de Plaisance</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: *Special rate for cyclists, <br>(Quebec National Park) <br>"Sépaq is proud to partner with Vélo Québec to establish a Welcome Cyclists campsite network. Enjoy campsites exclusively for touring cyclists. They’re easily accessible and available without advance booking.<br>Le Plateau campground<br><br> 2 campsites<br> 2 fire pits<br> 2 tables<br> Bike racks<br> Water access point: 200 m<br> La Carapace Visitors Centre nearby (community room - shelter, washroom, store and convenience store)<br> Lockers for food<br> Possibility of access via a cycling path<br> Sunny campsites<br><br>Information: 819 427-5350<br><br>Period: from the end of April to mid-October"<br>https://www.sepaq.com/pq/pla/index.dot#Item198c7371-83d3-43ca-aa9c-62cc5314304d<br><br>Type: Approved Accommodation (campground)]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1502-FFEA00</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[*Special rate for cyclists, 
(Quebec National Park) 
"Sépaq is proud to partner with Vélo Québec to establish a Welcome Cyclists campsite network. Enjoy campsites exclusively for touring cyclists. They’re easily accessible and available without advance booking.
Le Plateau campground

 2 campsites
 2 fire pits
 2 tables
 Bike racks
 Water access point: 200 m
 La Carapace Visitors Centre nearby (community room - shelter, washroom, store and convenience store)
 Lockers for food
 Possibility of access via a cycling path
 Sunny campsites

Information: 819 427-5350

Period: from the end of April to mid-October"
https://www.sepaq.com/pq/pla/index.dot#Item198c7371-83d3-43ca-aa9c-62cc5314304d
]]></value>
