In addition, as a Bienvenue cyclistes!-certified campground, it offers
*A pump and basic tools for minor repairs
A camping space, even without a reservation, if you are travelling exclusively by bicycle
A sheltered location where you can eat during inclement weather
Information about local bicycle networks and cycling services in the area

https://www.routeverte.com/en/hebergements/camping-rimouski-motel-de-lanse-2/ Privately Owned Campground
</value>
