      <Placemark>
        <name>Gagnon Beach</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: CHECK OUT IS AT 11AM and CHECK IN IS AT 1PM.<br><br>Unserviced (Field Camping) – Located in our open field area, this section is perfect for tenters! Pitch your tent(any size), park your vehicle and still have room for a campfire and picnic lunch. The added bonus is that you are only a short walk from our beautiful sandy beach!<br><br>Depending on the location of the tent site, Wi-fi signal may be connected to your devices at an additional cost. Washrooms with outdoor sink access and showers are available for campers’ use.<br><br> ADA Accessible<br> Back-In lots<br> Fire Pit provided<br> Pet-Friendly<br> Picnic Table provided<br> Coin operated laundry onsite<br><br>https://gagnonbeach.ca/rates-reservations/<br>Type: Privately Owned Campground<br>]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1765-9C27B0</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>CHECK OUT IS AT 11AM and CHECK IN IS AT 1PM.

Unserviced (Field Camping) – Located in our open field area, this section is perfect for tenters! Pitch your tent(any size), park your vehicle and still have room for a campfire and picnic lunch. The added bonus is that you are only a short walk from our beautiful sandy beach!

Depending on the location of the tent site, Wi-fi signal may be connected to your devices at an additional cost. Washrooms with outdoor sink access and showers are available for campers’ use.

 ADA Accessible
 Back-In lots
 Fire Pit provided
 Pet-Friendly
 Picnic Table provided
 Coin operated laundry onsite

https://gagnonbeach.ca/rates-reservations/</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Type">
            <value>Privately Owned Campground
</value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            -64.3307918,46.2243879,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
