        <name>Highbury Gardens RV Park</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: Features<br><br>Enjoy the clean, fresh air and outdoor lifestyle, without giving up all the comforts of home.<br><br>We offer our campers:18-web<br><br>RV Sites<br><br> Full Hook-Up (20, 30, and 50 Amp) 3 Way, 2 Way and unserviced sites<br> Pull-Thru Sites (Depending on availability)<br><br>Tenting Areas<br><br> Unserviced Sites<br><br>Note: Both wooded and open camping sites are available. Each site includes a picnic table and a fire pit.<br><br> Carded Electronic Security Gate<br> Function Room<br> Modern Washrooms<br> Games Room<br> Laundry Facilities<br> Swimming Pool<br><br> Convenience Store<br> Pets Permitted (on a leash)<br> Nature Trails<br> Quiet Hours (11 pm to 8 am)<br> Special Events<br> Friendly Atmosphere<br><br>https://highburygardens.com/features/<br>Type: Privately Owned Campground<br>]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1765-9C27B0</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>Features

Enjoy the clean, fresh air and outdoor lifestyle, without giving up all the comforts of home.

We offer our campers:18-web

RV Sites

 Full Hook-Up (20, 30, and 50 Amp) 3 Way, 2 Way and unserviced sites
 Pull-Thru Sites (Depending on availability)

Tenting Areas

 Unserviced Sites

Note: Both wooded and open camping sites are available. Each site includes a picnic table and a fire pit.

 Carded Electronic Security Gate
 Function Room
 Modern Washrooms
 Games Room
 Laundry Facilities
 Swimming Pool

 Convenience Store
 Pets Permitted (on a leash)
 Nature Trails
 Quiet Hours (11 pm to 8 am)
 Special Events
 Friendly Atmosphere

https://highburygardens.com/features/</value>
