      <Placemark>
        <name>Trent-Severn Waterway, Lock 33 - Lindsay</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: GPS: 44 21' 25" N ~ 78 44' 17" W<br>Mile # 156.4 (251.6 km)<br>Dimensions: 120' (36.6m) Long, 32' (9.7m) Wide<br>Average Lift: 7 ft (2.1 m)<br>Phone # (705) 324-2393<br><br>Lockstations with camping:<br><br>Tent camping is allowed at most lockstations on the Trent-Severn Waterway at the discretion of the lockmaster on duty. Sites are typically located in grassy areas around the lockstation and adjacent the waterway's mooring walls and/or paddle docks.<br>https://parks.canada.ca/lhn-nhs/on/trentsevern/activ/camping/tente-tent<br><br>Type: National Park Campground<br>]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1765-817717</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[GPS: 44 21' 25" N ~ 78 44' 17" W
Mile # 156.4 (251.6 km)
Dimensions: 120' (36.6m) Long, 32' (9.7m) Wide
Average Lift: 7 ft (2.1 m)
Phone # (705) 324-2393

Lockstations with camping:

Tent camping is allowed at most lockstations on the Trent-Severn Waterway at the discretion of the lockmaster on duty. Sites are typically located in grassy areas around the lockstation and adjacent the waterway's mooring walls and/or paddle docks.
https://parks.canada.ca/lhn-nhs/on/trentsevern/activ/camping/tente-tent
]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Type">
            <value>National Park Campground
</value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
