        <name>Hammock Harbour</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: "We have 2 areas of overnight camping - our main area includes 109-121 and 200-210. We also have a few back-in sites in our Pond area, 211 - 216. It is more private, quieter and looks out at a pond, has hydro and water, but has no shade. It is suitable for tents, or smaller trailers (34' max)."<br>https://www.hammockharbour.com/transient<br>Type: Privately Owned Campground<br>]]></description>
