        <name>White River Resort</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: "Tenting near the river or between the trees.<br><br>White River Resort has a large tenting area that is set in a meadow, surrounded by trees, and bordered on one side by the White River.<br><br>Campers in this area have their own power sources 15 and 30 amp, and a water tap at each site. Washrooms with flush toilets and shower facilities are also provided. Showers are coin operated, they accept loonies only."<br>https://saywardwhiteriverresort.com/<br>Type: Privately Owned Campground<br>]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1765-9C27B0</styleUrl>
