          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA["Tenting near the river or between the trees.

White River Resort has a large tenting area that is set in a meadow, surrounded by trees, and bordered on one side by the White River.

Campers in this area have their own power sources 15 and 30 amp, and a water tap at each site. Washrooms with flush toilets and shower facilities are also provided. Showers are coin operated, they accept loonies only."
